# literal_translation = But come, put on your warlike armor, so that bringing near the chariots of Ares and our own as quickly as possible we may fight, since he will surely not frighten the fearless son of Zeus nor the son of Iphicles, but I think he will flee the two sons of the blameless descendant of Alcaeus, who indeed are near them, eager to raise the battle-din of war, things which are far dearer to them than a feast.

